    "type": "service",
    "title": "Vegetation Condition Index (VCI)",
    "description": "Detects vegetation stress from a multi-year stack of Sentinel-2 NDVI observations. For each year in a configurable range, scenes within a \u00b1N-day calendar window around an anchor date are cloud-masked (threshold-based or SCL dilation) and merged; VCI expresses the most recent (observed) NDVI relative to the historical minimum and maximum NDVI within the same calendar window across prior years, highlighting vegetation stress such as drought or crop failure. Converted from the Sentinel Hub Vegetation Condition Index evalscript. Adapted from a SentinelHub Custom Script by Authors not listed.",
